sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor D as Dispatcher
    participant B as BI dashboard
    participant DB as Legacy database
    participant S as SOP files
    participant W as Weather website
    actor T as Tier 2 manager
    Note over D: Driver calls: cargo drifting above 0-4 °C
    D->>B: Log in with ID + password
    D->>B: Pick date range, risk class, lat/lon box
    B->>DB: Fixed report query (cryptic columns)
    DB-->>B: Rows: TS_UTC, V_LAT, IOT_TEMP_VAL_C ...
    B-->>D: Map, table, averages
    Note over D,B: No place names, no truck ID, averages hide breaches
    D->>S: Search folders for the right rule
    S-->>D: A rule (maybe an old copy)
    D->>W: Check weather for the coordinates
    W-->>D: Conditions
    Note over D: Combine everything by hand and decide
    D->>T: Phone call if escalation is needed
    Note over D,T: No record of how the decision was made
